+
+usage:
+  gstack-review-log '<json>'        one record, a single JSON object
+  gstack-review-log --file <path>   read the record from a file
+  gstack-review-log -               read the record from stdin
+  gstack-review-log --schema        print the record's JSON Schema
+  gstack-review-log --help          this text
+
